WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:03.819
"Stop!" Roxy cried as an alien stomped toward her.

2
00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:07.191
All the fighters were in the stadium, having an enormous battle.

3
00:00:07.192 --> 00:00:11.219
"No way! I want that golden asteroid!"

4
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:15.100
The alien swung a wooden club, which Roxy easily dodged.

5
00:00:15.101 --> 00:00:18.131
"This is ridiculous," Roxy said.

6
00:00:18.132 --> 00:00:21.664
"We should all fight the Battle Master—not each other!"

7
00:00:21.665 --> 00:00:25.017
"Grr!" The alien swung his club again.

8
00:00:25.018 --> 00:00:28.095
Roxy stepped to the side and then stared at the club.

9
00:00:28.096 --> 00:00:32.583
Orange beams radiated from her eyes until the club burst into flames.

10
00:00:32.584 --> 00:00:35.762
"Yikes!" The alien dropped the club.

11
00:00:35.763 --> 00:00:41.904
Roxy darted away and found Cozlin, who was also trying to avoid the fight.

12
00:00:41.905 --> 00:00:44.915
"This is terrible," Roxy said.

13
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:50.849
Cozlin nodded. "I agree—we have to get out of here. Where's Wukong?"

14
00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.062
"Ahh!" Nebulon darted past.

15
00:00:54.063 --> 00:00:57.993
A big crab was chasing the warrior, snapping its claws at his feet.

16
00:00:57.994 --> 00:00:59.962
The crab stopped and looked at them.

17
00:00:59.963 --> 00:01:02.811
Light sparkled, and the crab turned into Wukong.

18
00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:06.420
He laughed. "This is fun!"

19
00:01:06.421 --> 00:01:10.196
Roxy rolled her eyes. "We need to get out of here."

20
00:01:10.197 --> 00:01:15.417
Wukong sighed. "I know. Maybe Sapphire can help us."

21
00:01:15.418 --> 00:01:17.917
"Where is she?" Roxy looked around.

22
00:01:17.918 --> 00:01:21.325
Cozlin pointed and laughed. "Over there!"

23
00:01:21.326 --> 00:01:25.925
Roxy and Wukong looked over and saw the big dragon fast asleep.

24
00:01:25.926 --> 00:01:31.251
Suddenly a deep voice boomed. "The golden asteroid is mine!"

25
00:01:31.252 --> 00:01:35.051
They looked up and saw a gorilla with wings standing on the asteroid.

26
00:01:35.052 --> 00:01:38.373
The slug flew up to it and knocked off the gorilla.

27
00:01:38.374 --> 00:01:42.002
The slug laughed. "Now it's mine!"

28
00:01:42.003 --> 00:01:46.049
"Not for long!" Volgren leaped up to the platform.

29
00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:50.692
One of her tentacles grabbed the edge, throwing the entire platform off balance.

30
00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:55.353
"Waa!" The slug fell off—and so did the asteroid!

31
00:01:55.354 --> 00:01:59.871
It hit the ground with a thud. Right away, fighters clambered over to it.

32
00:01:59.872 --> 00:02:01.607
"It's mine!"

33
00:02:01.608 --> 00:02:04.518
"No way—I got to it first!"

34
00:02:04.519 --> 00:02:07.118
Roxy heard heavy footsteps and spun around.

35
00:02:07.119 --> 00:02:09.594
A big robot was running toward her.

36
00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:12.428
Roxy's eyes went wide. "Terrell?"

37
00:02:12.429 --> 00:02:16.795
Then she saw a small, flying robot and smiled. "Bippo!"

38
00:02:16.796 --> 00:02:18.905
"Hero, me!"

39
00:02:18.906 --> 00:02:22.184
The big robot's head opened, and Terrell grinned.

40
00:02:22.185 --> 00:02:25.515
"Dr. Odd got the force field down! Let's get out of—"

41
00:02:25.516 --> 00:02:28.828
Bam! A green monster knocked him over.

42
00:02:28.829 --> 00:02:35.230
"Mean, you!" Bippo fired his laser at the monster. Pew!

43
00:02:35.231 --> 00:02:38.982
Terrell jumped back to his feet and closed the robot's head.

44
00:02:38.983 --> 00:02:42.858
When a large alien jumped toward him, he swung his big fist.

45
00:02:42.859 --> 00:02:46.561
Pow! The alien tumbled backward.

46
00:02:46.562 --> 00:02:53.424
Roxy had had enough. "Everyone, stop fighting!" she yelled, but nobody listened.

47
00:02:53.425 --> 00:02:57.866
She sighed. Then she noticed brown specks on the asteroid.

48
00:02:57.867 --> 00:03:02.325
She looked closely and gasped. "Those aren't specks!"

49
00:03:02.326 --> 00:03:05.886
She fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

50
00:03:05.887 --> 00:03:08.871
The asteroid exploded into several pieces.

51
00:03:08.872 --> 00:03:12.125
The inside wasn't gold at all—it was brown.

52
00:03:12.126 --> 00:03:16.149
"Aha!" Roxy said. "It's not a golden asteroid!

53
00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:18.123
It was just painted gold!"

54
00:03:18.124 --> 00:03:19.526
The fighting stopped.

55
00:03:19.527 --> 00:03:24.317
The slug frowned. "It's a fake?"

56
00:03:24.318 --> 00:03:27.607
"Where's the Battle Master?" Kothar asked.

57
00:03:27.608 --> 00:03:30.199
"He has some explaining to do!"

58
00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.254
Audience members began to murmur.

59
00:03:32.255 --> 00:03:34.863
"The asteroid is fake!"

60
00:03:34.864 --> 00:03:37.722
"The Battle Master is a fraud!"

61
00:03:37.723 --> 00:03:41.368
Roxy looked around and saw the Battle Master up on his platform.

62
00:03:41.369 --> 00:03:45.015
He pressed a button, and the platform shot toward an exit.

63
00:03:45.016 --> 00:03:49.906
The Battle Master jumped off and ran!

